[Risk "medium"]
[EarlyMate "none"]
[Tricks "trap,hanging-piece"]
[Themes "hanging-knight"]
[Refutes "1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5?! 3. exd5 e4 4. Ng5"]
[Kind "against-us"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5?! 3. exd5 e4 4. Ng5? { Dodges the pawn, but lands on a square the black queen already covers along the diagonal from d8. } 4... Qxg5 { Takes the knight for nothing. } 5. Nc3 Qe5 { Escapes the attack and keeps the queen in the centre, while Black is a whole piece up. } 6. Qe2 Nf6 *
